{"id":"d625bf896919d407","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-recursion-theorem.md","title":"Recursion Theorem","display":"thm-recursion-theorem — Recursion Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-recursion-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-recursion-theorem"],"display":"thm-recursion-theorem — Recursion Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§8.7 p.25 / PDF 34; index-transformer corollary","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-local-corollary-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-recursion-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-recursion-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recursion-theorem — Recursion Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4d2f7264607dcc1\" href=\"?note=c4d2f7264607dcc1\" title=\"68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem\">68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§8.7 p.25 / PDF 34; index-transformer corollary"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-local-corollary-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是全递归函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bca7d0eca4017dc7\" href=\"?note=bca7d0eca4017dc7\" title=\"68-df-kleene-normal-form\">68-df-kleene-normal-form</a>。使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c4d2f7264607dcc1\" href=\"?note=c4d2f7264607dcc1\" title=\"68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem\">68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem</a> 的 k=1 情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq\\varphi_{f(e)}(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq\\varphi_{f(e)}(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 8.7 的标准索引不动点推论。令 G(x,y)≃φ_{f(y)}(x)，由枚举定理和复合知 G 偏递归，再应用带参数的原书递归定理。此处固定点是外延函数相等，不要求程序编号满足 e=f(e)。原先前提和 Assertion 重复绑定 f 的写法已整理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c4d2f7264607dcc1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是全递归函数，见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]；$\\varphi_e$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。使用 [[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]] 的 k=1 情形。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-kleene-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"bca7d0eca4017dc7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是全递归函数，见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]；$\\varphi_e$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。使用 [[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]] 的 k=1 情形。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c4d2f7264607dcc1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是全递归函数，见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]；$\\varphi_e$ 见 [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。使用 [[68-thm-shoenfield-recursion-theorem]] 的 k=1 情形。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq\\varphi_{f(e)}(x)).","display":true}],"bytes":1318,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-recursion-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-th